            "review_text": "Gee_Erm\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam58 contributions\n1\nWould you like some SNOT with your croissant Sir?\nSep 2019 • Family\nAre there any Managers monitoring staff at Annam? \n\nWhilst ordering from the bakery this morning, I watched the young female staff gouge something out of her nose then flick it into the floor. The \"snot hand\" was then used to open the paper bag before bare \"snot hand\" picked up my croissant.\n\nWhilst I am not partial to booger encrusted croissants, I am sure there are members of the public that have a fetish for nose goo.\n\nSo if you are in the market for baked goods with extra nose flavour, check-out Annam bakery.\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2019",
