            "review_title": "Review at Annam Cafe Gourmet",
            "review_text": "Cate71\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam147 contributions\n0\nShopping trip\nSep 2019 • Solo\nWhilst I very much like this place and have eaten here and enjoyed my meal, the service at the registers is painfully slow and tiring. I am often here and never have I seen workers move as slowly as they seem to at Annam. I am also sick and tired of other customers interrupting cashiers for help when I am being served. This happens here and lots of places in Viet and it drives me crazy. Tell the other customer you are serving someone and to wait!! Today I had to wait for my cashier to finally realise that she had already taken my member card, go through the registered items and check the docket 3 times until she was satisfied. Meanwhile being interrupted by another customer twice (same person).\nRead more\nWritten September 29, 2019",
