            "review_text": "Steve K\nToronto, Canada23 contributions\n0\nFalse Advertising\nAug 2019 • Solo\nI’m tired of false advertising or assertions favoring a business. Plates here say “served with mixed salad”. What do you think of when thinking of mixed salad?Probably lettuce with two or three items like tomatoes or cucumbers or onion, right?! Here it is just a couple or a few pieces of lettuce mixed with...nothing but soya sauce, False advertising! It should just say, “served with bits of lettuce”. Of course they won’t say that, but that’s the truth. So either re-define your menu or re-think your servings\nRead more\nWritten August 23, 2019",
