            "review_text": "ZhongguoKM\nDallas, Texas6211 contributions\n0\nBought coffee here\nMay 2019 • Solo\nI was looking for some highlands Robusta coffee beans, dark roast, to take back with me to brew at home after returning from my Vietnam trip. Found some here at a reasonable price. Store clerk knew enough to help me select what I was after. \n\nThought about having lunch, but was not there at the right time of day. The buffet looked attractive. \n\nThis isn't a place to go looking for bargains. It's the place to come if you can't find something in a less exclusive venue.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 11, 2019",
